OL,3,ABaby wards in England to get cot cams,
OL,4,Asays government, after inquiry into
OL,5,ALucy Letby hospital deaths
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe inquiry found some deaths at the
OL,8,FCountess of Chester Hospital could have
OL,9,Fbeen prevented, with Lady Justice
OL,10,FThirlwall saying there was a "complete
OL,11,Ffailure to protect babies" - other key
OL,12,Ffindings
OL,14,FResponding to the report, the hospital
OL,15,Fsays it is "sorry for the events that
OL,16,Foccurred in 2015 and 2016", and it's a
OL,17,F"different organisation today with new
OL,18,Fleadership, stronger governance and
OL,19,Fsafety processes"
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
