OL,3,ABaby wards in England to get cot cams,
OL,4,Asays government, after inquiry into
OL,5,ALucy Letby hospital deaths
OL,6,
OL,7,FLetby is serving 15 whole-life prison
OL,8,Fterms for murdering seven babies and
OL,9,Fattempting to murder seven more. She
OL,10,Fwas convicted in 2023 and has twice
OL,11,Fbeen denied permission to appeal
OL,12,Fagainst her convictions
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/40
