OL,3,APolitical donors could face tougher
OL,4,Aresidency rules
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government is planning to tighten
OL,7,Fresidency rules for political donors to
OL,8,Fensure that those giving significant
OL,9,Famounts of money reside in the UK.
OL,11,FThe announcement follows a row over two
OL,12,Fdonations totalling #72m to Reform UK
OL,13,Ffrom two British crypto-billionaires
OL,14,Fwho have both recently lived abroad.
OL,16,FReform leader Nigel Farage said the
OL,17,Fdonations from Ben Delo and Christopher
OL,18,FHarborne are "100% compliant with the
OL,19,Flaw today" but he was unable to say
OL,20,Fthey would be permissible under
OL,21,Fproposed rule changes.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/40
