OL,3,AWhat weapon could the US have put into
OL,4,Aspace?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe announcement by the United States
OL,7,Fthat it has deployed a space weapon in
OL,8,FEarth's orbit has raised questions
OL,9,Fabout what weaponry is actually in
OL,10,Fspace, and what role it could play in
OL,11,Fefforts by great powers to dominate
OL,12,Fthat arena.
OL,14,FWashington has given away little in its
OL,15,Fannouncement. Secretary of the Air
OL,16,FForce Troy Meink said the "on orbit"
OL,17,Fweapon was necessary to safeguard US
OL,18,Fforces against hostile enemy action,
OL,19,Fbut gave no details about the weapon's
OL,20,Fcapabilities or when it was put into
OL,21,Forbit.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
