OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AWhat weapon could the US have put into
OL,4,Aspace?
OL,5,
OL,6,FSo what could this weapon be, and what
OL,7,Fis wider picture like for military
OL,8,Fdevelopments in space? Who else could
OL,9,Fhave similar weaponry?
OL,11,FAdvanced militaries already deploy
OL,12,Fsatellites in space for range of
OL,13,Fpurposes, from supplying secure
OL,14,Fcommunications to reconnaissance, and
OL,15,Fproviding precise location information
OL,16,Ffor targeted strikes and detecting
OL,17,Fmissile launches.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/40
